```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant user
    participant browser
    participant server

    user->>browser: Write note and click Save
    Note right of browser: Browser get the user input and prepares to send it to the server

    browser->>server: POST https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/new_note_spa with new data of note
    activate server
    Note right of server: Server receive the new data of note  and save it
    server-->>browser: { "content": "new note", "date": "2026-8-11" }
    deactivate server

    Note right of browser: The browser update the notes list dynamically without reloading the page
    browser->>browser: Render DOM and show the new note in the list

```
